          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "Warnings were issued for Estenwick, Dray Corners, and Ostley County on May 19 starting at 15:36 UTC; evacuations occurred from Estenwick and Dray Corners beginning at 19:00 UTC on May 19; Route 12 and grain elevator were destroyed in Dray Corners by 19:52 UTC on May 19; 3 fatalities were reported in Millrow district on May 19; 38 injuries were documented in Estenwick on May 20; 9 deaths occurred in the county by May 20; dangerous conditions developed at Dray Corners and Palfrey on May 21; Estenwick Consolidated School and its gymnasium were destroyed on May 22; Route 12 and grain elevator were restored on May 23.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
